A '''cavity''' can be found in the lobby area of the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It allows players to deposit and retrieve their [[pickaxe]] that is used during the [[Tombs_of_Amascut/Strategies#Challenge_room_3|Path of Het challenge room]] from the lobby, and functions identically to the [[Statue (Tombs of Amascut)|statue]] in the same room. As such, using it requires having first reached the challenge room during the [[miniquest]] [[Into the Tombs]], as it will appear as a generic wall before doing so.

If a player attempts to place a [[bronze pickaxe]] in the cavity, they will receive a game message stating {{Mes|There's no point storing a bronze pickaxe here. Het will provide.}}

When adding in the [[Trailblazer pickaxe|Trailblazer Reloaded pickaxe]], the model will still show the old 2020 model.

